The light of your Radiance allows you to see that which would normally be unseen and strike that which would normally be protected.

All enemies in your Radiance aura have their invisibility and stealth power reduced by [74;, 95;, 110;, 124;, 136 (TL1-5; SP 100)]; all actors affected by illumination have their defense reduced by [24, 31, 36, 41, 45 (TL1-5; SP 100)] as well as all evasion bonuses from being unseen negated.

In addition, your light damage is increased by [2%, 5%, 6%, 8%, 10% (TL1-5)] and your strikes ignore [10%, 27%, 36%, 42%, 46% (TL1-5)] of the light resistance of your targets.

The invisibility, stealth power, and defense reductions increase with your Spellpower.
